  "description": {
   "en": "\"Then let me touch you,\" Kubo-kun buried his face in my chest... This can't be a dream...!? One morning in the elevator, Mitsuhashi, an office lady with a marshmallow figure, was suddenly licked off her sweat by Kubo-kun, a popular new employee!! On top of that, he always treated Mitsuhashi like a woman... I can't help but fall in love!! Will Mitsuhashi, who has hidden feelings for Kubo-kun, spend the night with him?!",
   "ja": "「じゃあ、触らせてよ」久保君が私の胸に顔をうずめて…夢じゃ、ないよね…!?　マシュマロ体型のOL・三橋は、ある朝エレベーターで、人気者の新入社員・久保くんに、イキナリ汗を舐められちゃった!!　その上彼は、何かと三橋を女性扱いしてくれて…もぉ、好きになっちゃうよ!!　想いを秘めた三橋が、久保くんと一夜を過ごすコトに!?"
  },
